      "writtenOn": "2012-09-12T16:13:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this isn\u0027t going to work.  You have a window between the two sync blocks in which someone can acquire a wake lock and inc the pending count and then you will release it when it shouldn\u0027t be.\n\nThe safe/easy way is to using a single lock object.  There may be another safe way to do it using two locks.  I\u0027m not sure if the optimization of using two locks is worth it - take a look.",
